<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Deelkraal still in talks with Elandsrand.</title>
<headline>Deelkraal still in talks with Elandsrand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold mines Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd and Elandsrand Gold Mining Co Ltd said on Friday that there had been no further developments in their ongoing talks.</p>
<p>The firms added that shareholders should continue to exercise caution in dealing with the firms' stock.</p>
<p>The two mines first announced talks aimed at a possible tie-up on August 23. The neighbouring mines said at that time the target was realising benefits which could be achieved through joint-action.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
